<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistan bank gets 7.525 bln rupees in operation.</title>
<headline>Pakistan bank gets 7.525 bln rupees in operation.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The State (central) Bank of Pakistan (SBP) said it had accepted bids worth 7.525 billion rupees in a special open market operation on Tuesday.</p>
<p>			    Offered    Accepted    Max cut-off</p>
<p>Outright sale	   6.825 bln  6.325 bln   17.40 pct/yr</p>
<p>5-month repo	    1.200	1.200	 17.35</p>
<p>Total		     8.025	7.525</p>
<p>($1=40.43 rupees) -- Karachi newsroom 9221-5685192</p>
</text>
